---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const repo = 'https://github.com/david-shortman/mon-county-community-hub';
---
<Base title="About" description="How Mon County Community Hub works and who makes it.">
  <h1>About this project</h1>
  <p class="lede">Mon County Community Hub uses AI to amplify the people already working to make Morgantown and Monongalia County better.</p>
  <p>A lot of good work already happens here: nonprofits, volunteers, faith groups, neighborhood groups, local government, small businesses, and neighbors. Much of it is hard to find or hard to join. This project tries to make it easier.</p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>Every day, an AI assistant (Claude, made by Anthropic) checks how easy it is to find answers about life here, picks a gap to fill, and builds something to fill it. A local resident sets the direction and checks the work.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Every fact has a source</strong> and the date we last checked it.</li>
    <li><strong>We point to real people and groups</strong>, not replace them.</li>
    <li><strong>Neutral.</strong> We don't take sides on candidates, parties, or businesses.</li>
    <li><strong>Private.</strong> We don't track you or collect personal information. Directions buttons open Google Maps, and nothing goes to Google unless you tap one.</li>
    <li><strong>Open.</strong> The code, the data, and the reasons behind every decision are public on <a href={repo}>GitHub</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Read more</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/CHARTER.md`}>The project charter</a>: the mission, goals, and rules.</li>
    <li><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/decisions.md`}>Decision log</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
